# Chay Runtime

When this project contains `chay-memory/` or `.chay/`, read `chay-memory/rules/chay-runtime.md` before coding.

Never choose files only from generic words like `user`; follow `chay-structure/features/<feature_id>.md`, `chay-structure/folder_structure.md`, `chay-structure/api_graph.md`, and graph `code_targets`.
